<p>Gets a local itemproperty variable on an object.
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Itemproperty%20keyword" title="Itemproperty keyword">itemproperty</a> GetLocalItemProperty(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> oObject,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/String%20keyword" title="String keyword">string</a> sVarName<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oObject<dd>Object to get the variable from<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">sVarName<dd>The name of the variable to retrieve
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
<p><dd>Returns an itemproperty variable, returns an invalid itemproperty on error.
</p>
</dl><dl><dt>Source:
<p><dd><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Script.ldf" title="Script.ldf">script.ldf</a>
